  "decision": "The new actual-HIP convolution probe checks both ring storage types, complete widened output and active history, stored current values, unowned slots, redzones and immutable inputs. An ASan/UBSan controller HIP execution mock reproduces one qualified original input and rejects eight faults. The initial observer missed two transient input changes across layouts; each invocation now verifies inputs before the next. These are observer checks only. Native compilation and GPU execution remain pending; no mock is included in the native probe.",
